1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,787
Still resizing your browser window back and forth to test responsive layouts?

2
00:00:05,788 --> 00:00:10,688
Checking screens one by one is slow and makes it easy to miss visual bugs.

3
00:00:11,867 --> 00:00:13,092
Meet ViewGrid.

4
00:00:13,092 --> 00:00:20,454
A unified workspace that brings mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports side by side inside a single browser tab.

5
00:00:21,533 --> 00:00:25,733
Scroll on one screen, and see every device follow along.

6
00:00:25,733 --> 00:00:30,245
Test interactions across all breakpoints simultaneously.

7
00:00:31,367 --> 00:00:37,255
Overlay exported design mockups onto the live page to compare alignment and spacing.

8
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:45,475
Use curated device presets and the issue scanner to spot potential responsive problems.

9
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,075
Built local-first with zero telemetry.

10
00:00:50,075 --> 00:00:55,625
It runs directly inside your browser with full privacy on localhost and staging.

11
00:00:56,867 --> 00:00:58,842
Stop dragging your browser window.

12
00:00:58,842 --> 00:01:02,529
Install ViewGrid free for Chrome and Firefox.

